    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ES RPS by operation",
      "description": "Запросы в OpenSearch с разбивкой по типу: search (поиск каталога), bulk (P7: feed-индексация одним батчем), index_doc (одиночные апдейты), delete_by_query, count, cluster_health, index_exists, create_index. На bulk особо смотри — он идёт внутри outbox tick'a.",
      "id": 71,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 71 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (op) (rate(es_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{op}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal" }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ES p95 latency by operation",
      "description": "p95 латентность OS. Пороги: yellow 1s, red 5s. На bulk эти пороги критичны — он сидит внутри outbox-handler'a и удлиняет lease. Search обычно <100ms.",
      "id": 72,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 71 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, op) (rate(es_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{op}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
